The Wild Island forest surrounds you, and you instantly realize that you've gone too far. It's necessary to return for help, but it's not so easy to find the way back. You could follow your trail, but there is a dense carpet of musty foliage on the ground, making it impossible to see any footprints. You try to listen for the roar of clashing edges of two islands, but it is lost in the noise of disturbed inhabitants of the forest. It seems you're completely lost.

